WEBVTT

00:00:00.560 --> 00:00:03.520
I'm gonna be the first-star idol one day!

00:00:03.520 --> 00:00:07.650
Nijino Yume's about to start her Aikatsu!

00:00:10.360 --> 00:00:13.950
Aikatsu Island is generating so much hype!

00:00:13.950 --> 00:00:17.580
It's the biggest event of the summer after all.

00:00:18.160 --> 00:00:20.120
I can't contain my excitement!

00:00:21.200 --> 00:00:23.460
Yume-chan, it's about to start.

00:00:23.460 --> 00:00:25.580
S4 TV, right?

00:00:28.090 --> 00:00:32.130
S4 Presents: It's Our Job to Shine.

00:00:32.130 --> 00:00:33.720
We'll be your hosts.

00:00:33.720 --> 00:00:37.220
The four glimmering stars, S4!

00:00:37.220 --> 00:00:41.100
We're in the height of summer.
How are you all enjoying yourselves?

00:00:41.100 --> 00:00:43.730
We're filming a movie!

00:00:43.730 --> 00:00:45.650
They're making a movie!

00:00:45.650 --> 00:00:48.230
S4's always so busy.

00:00:48.230 --> 00:00:53.360
Taking up the megaphone will be Director Jean, a genius from the Hong Kong film industry. {you can see his name in a later show}

00:00:53.360 --> 00:00:56.360
Its title is Bodybird. {or Body-bird. of course a play on Bodyguard}

00:00:56.740 --> 00:01:01.370
And our very own Tsubasacchi is playing Bird, the lead heroine!

00:01:03.750 --> 00:01:08.460
As with any action movie, recording many of the scenes is quite the challenge.

00:01:08.460 --> 00:01:12.840
But everyone on set is a professional who takes pride in their work.

00:01:12.840 --> 00:01:16.380
We're all doing everything we can to make the director's vision a reality.

00:01:16.380 --> 00:01:18.140
She's incredible.

00:01:18.590 --> 00:01:22.640
I promise it will be a fine piece of work, so expect greatness.

00:01:22.640 --> 00:01:25.350
On the count of one, two, three!

00:01:25.350 --> 00:01:27.650
Look forward to it!

00:01:27.650 --> 00:01:30.150
I wanna see! I wanna see so bad!

00:01:30.150 --> 00:01:31.900
Yeah, I'm excited for the movie.

00:01:31.900 --> 00:01:34.940
There's that too, but I want to see the film set!

00:01:34.940 --> 00:01:35.780
Huh?

00:01:35.780 --> 00:01:40.160
Even Tsubasa-senpai admitted how challenging work there is.

00:01:40.160 --> 00:01:42.290
Let's invite Rola and go watch!

00:01:42.290 --> 00:01:44.790
But don't you think they'd mind?

00:01:44.790 --> 00:01:48.460
I'm sure it'll be fine! This is just part of our Aikatsu.

00:04:01.470 --> 00:04:05.680
You're a billion years too early to challenge a racer like me.{I mean, this isn't exactly right either, but at least it's closer (also pls with the double typo (and the version of throw down you're thinking of is not used like this))}

00:04:07.390 --> 00:04:09.140
Cut!

00:04:09.140 --> 00:04:11.430
We're okay, yeah? {I don't know how much this'll follow through, not sure even how to make him sound more hong kongy}{is he even hongkongian? he's just part of the film industry there}

00:04:13.020 --> 00:04:15.400
We're good with this scene!

00:04:21.150 --> 00:04:24.320
Tsubasa-senpai is the coolest!

00:04:24.320 --> 00:04:25.570
So awesome!

00:04:25.570 --> 00:04:28.200
Hey, keep your voices down.

00:04:28.200 --> 00:04:29.240
Sorry.

00:04:29.240 --> 00:04:31.910
So, what kind of movie is this?

00:04:35.460 --> 00:04:40.090
Let's see... the protagonist is the president of a large company, Nishi Taiyou-san.

00:04:40.090 --> 00:04:45.930
Tsubasa-senpai starts as a racer, but due to a series of events ends up as Taiyou-san's bodyguard.

00:04:46.220 --> 00:04:47.720
That gets me going!

00:04:47.720 --> 00:04:49.390
What about the rest of S4?

00:04:49.390 --> 00:04:51.520
They're Taiyou-san's secretaries.

00:04:51.520 --> 00:04:54.020
Wow, I can't wait!

00:04:54.020 --> 00:04:56.600
But where's Taiyou-san in all this?

00:04:56.600 --> 00:04:58.560
Look, he's over there.

00:04:59.320 --> 00:05:04.320
I recognize him. He's a famous actor who's been acting all his life.

00:05:04.320 --> 00:05:08.280
Yeah. He's starred in countless films,

00:05:08.280 --> 00:05:11.450
but he's best known for his role in "Burn at the Sun". {taiyou ni moero is a cat thing, taiyou ni hoero is a tv series, moero! taiyou is a movie. }

00:05:15.160 --> 00:05:17.330
Go!

00:05:18.960 --> 00:05:21.130
He sounds like a great actor.{not necessarily skill, etc}

00:05:21.130 --> 00:05:23.090
Huh, where'd it go?

00:05:23.090 --> 00:05:25.090
Man...

00:05:25.090 --> 00:05:26.090
Oh no!

00:05:30.100 --> 00:05:31.970
Hey, manager.

00:05:31.970 --> 00:05:33.270
Y-Yes?

00:05:33.270 --> 00:05:37.850
In the next scene, what is the meaning of having me, the lead, covered in mud?

00:05:37.850 --> 00:05:39.190
I'll see...

00:05:39.190 --> 00:05:41.980
I expect there to be a stand-in.

00:05:43.230 --> 00:05:45.150
There <i>will</i> be a stand-in.

00:05:46.950 --> 00:05:48.700
I'll go speak with the director.

00:05:50.490 --> 00:05:51.950
Worthless...

00:05:52.790 --> 00:05:54.330
Good afternoon.

00:05:55.080 --> 00:05:56.750
And you were...

00:05:56.750 --> 00:05:58.750
Kisaragi Tsubasa.

00:05:59.380 --> 00:06:03.500
Not that I care, but could you not get so into this?

00:06:04.550 --> 00:06:09.220
You probably just got the role because you're singing the theme song.

00:06:09.220 --> 00:06:10.510
That isn't...

00:06:10.510 --> 00:06:14.520
An idol doesn't need to do anything besides act like one.

00:06:16.600 --> 00:06:18.390
Wh-Who are you?!

00:06:19.020 --> 00:06:22.020
You're not paparazzi, are you?{okay... I think}

00:06:25.030 --> 00:06:26.280
Nijino?

00:06:26.280 --> 00:06:28.150
Explain yourselves!

00:06:28.150 --> 00:06:29.780
We're sorry.

00:06:29.780 --> 00:06:33.780
I apologize on their behalf. 
They're students from my school.

00:06:33.780 --> 00:06:37.500
Oh, they are? Well, if that's all...

00:06:37.500 --> 00:06:39.040
I'll leave them to you.

00:06:39.040 --> 00:06:41.210
I'm sorry for the disturbance.

00:06:43.630 --> 00:06:45.090
What are you doing?

00:06:45.090 --> 00:06:49.550
I'm sorry, I just thought that seeing pros at work would help our Aikatsu.

00:06:52.720 --> 00:06:54.060
Give me a minute.

00:06:58.560 --> 00:07:00.560
Hold on to these.

00:07:01.480 --> 00:07:02.650
What are they?

00:07:02.650 --> 00:07:04.650
I got permission for you to observe.

00:07:04.650 --> 00:07:05.190
Huh?

00:07:05.190 --> 00:07:06.570
We can stay?

00:07:06.570 --> 00:07:11.570
So long as you don't cause the staff any trouble and be sure to have good manners.

00:07:11.570 --> 00:07:15.080
Okay, I promise to have good manners!

00:07:15.620 --> 00:07:17.410
So what are manners?

00:07:18.580 --> 00:07:21.500
There are too many to list, but for instance...

00:07:22.580 --> 00:07:24.840
Final take!

00:07:24.840 --> 00:07:29.840
Silence your breathing during recording so that they don't pick up any sounds.

00:07:29.840 --> 00:07:31.340
Action!

00:07:36.010 --> 00:07:37.640
Okay, yeah!

00:07:40.850 --> 00:07:43.480
I said nothing of holding your breath.

00:07:43.480 --> 00:07:44.770
Whoops.

00:07:45.980 --> 00:07:49.530
You should also be aware that the camera has a wide field of view.

00:07:49.530 --> 00:07:52.240
Be careful not to get in the way.

00:07:52.240 --> 00:07:55.240
Don't touch any of the equipment either.

00:07:55.240 --> 00:07:57.240
Okay, I understand.

00:07:57.240 --> 00:08:02.250
We're now going on break! 
Please be back by 2 PM!

00:08:04.710 --> 00:08:08.250
Sorry for making you treat us to lunch.

00:08:08.250 --> 00:08:10.010
Don't concern yourself.

00:08:10.010 --> 00:08:14.760
If we only had boxed lunches it would be a problem, but today it's homemade.

00:08:20.770 --> 00:08:23.140
This smell must be curry.

00:08:23.140 --> 00:08:24.480
Dong-ding!

00:08:25.020 --> 00:08:26.770
Hime-senpai!

00:08:26.770 --> 00:08:29.780
It's Hime's special stamina curry.

00:08:29.780 --> 00:08:31.690
Why are you serving?

00:08:31.690 --> 00:08:33.400
It's not just her.

00:08:36.030 --> 00:08:37.410
Yozora-senpai.

00:08:37.410 --> 00:08:39.030
And Yuzu-senpai!

00:08:39.030 --> 00:08:43.910
Dry skin is your worst enemy. 
Try some of my 99-ingredient salad.

00:08:43.910 --> 00:08:48.420
And for dessert, Happy Koi-Koi Konpeito Sherbet!

00:08:48.420 --> 00:08:50.420
Why are you all doing this?

00:08:50.420 --> 00:08:56.010
The three of them had time before their next appearance, so they volunteered to help.

00:08:56.010 --> 00:08:58.300
But they're in S4.

00:08:58.300 --> 00:09:00.470
That has nothing to do with it.

00:09:00.470 --> 00:09:04.560
Everyone on the staff works together to create a single film.

00:09:04.560 --> 00:09:06.810
Cooperation is important!{oh man, I kinda want to adopt new yorker style for maximum trolling}

00:09:08.900 --> 00:09:13.650
Each person adds what they can to the production of a single work.

00:09:14.820 --> 00:09:16.240
That's right.

00:09:20.120 --> 00:09:21.410
It's delicious!

00:09:21.410 --> 00:09:24.910
But will I really be able to finish it all?

00:09:26.080 --> 00:09:27.670
Thank you for the meal.

00:09:28.500 --> 00:09:30.420
You ate all of it?

00:09:30.420 --> 00:09:33.420
It's important not to leave a single crumb behind.

00:09:33.420 --> 00:09:36.470
Acting is a battle of stamina. Later.

00:09:39.300 --> 00:09:42.310
M-M-My sincerest apologies!

00:09:42.310 --> 00:09:44.310
Yes, of course.

00:09:44.310 --> 00:09:46.770
I'll be very stern with Taiyou.

00:09:51.270 --> 00:09:55.150
The offer for you to play the lead in the next movie went up in smoke.

00:09:56.400 --> 00:10:00.280
Well, I don't particularly care. 
It was a boring one anyway.

00:10:01.410 --> 00:10:05.200
Taiyou-san, I want to see the person you used to be!

00:10:07.080 --> 00:10:09.750
You used to be so passionate...

00:10:10.380 --> 00:10:12.840
Why have you changed?

00:10:18.220 --> 00:10:21.220
Everyone prepare to resume filming!

00:10:21.220 --> 00:10:23.810
Let's see, the next scene is...

00:10:24.470 --> 00:10:26.230
Hime-senpai's appearance!

00:10:29.480 --> 00:10:30.600
So mature!

00:10:30.600 --> 00:10:32.730
They feel so different from usual.{印象, not 衣装}{I know that, the important part was impression}

00:10:35.730 --> 00:10:37.240
Action!

00:10:41.240 --> 00:10:43.200
Leave them to us!

00:10:43.200 --> 00:10:44.740
We'll handle it!

00:10:45.540 --> 00:10:46.540
This way!

00:10:49.370 --> 00:10:50.750
Cut!

00:10:51.040 --> 00:10:52.750
Okay, yeah!

00:10:52.750 --> 00:10:56.380
Approved! Tsubasa-san, you're up next!

00:10:58.010 --> 00:10:59.090
Action!

00:10:59.880 --> 00:11:02.930
I understand that you dislike me.

00:11:02.930 --> 00:11:05.260
Regardless, I'm your bodyguard.

00:11:07.020 --> 00:11:09.600
I take pride in my work.

00:11:09.600 --> 00:11:10.890
Stop rolling.

00:11:12.650 --> 00:11:14.650
What's the matter?

00:11:15.020 --> 00:11:16.650
It's <i>pride</i>.

00:11:16.650 --> 00:11:18.150
Pride?

00:11:18.150 --> 00:11:21.160
The correct pronunciation is <i>pride</i>.

00:11:21.160 --> 00:11:23.160
Pride...

00:11:23.160 --> 00:11:24.740
Yes. That.

00:11:24.740 --> 00:11:26.910
I'll confirm and be right back.

00:11:26.910 --> 00:11:29.870
And for your information, it's <i>bodyguard</i>.

00:11:34.630 --> 00:11:36.840
Doesn't that just make it sound weirder?

00:11:36.840 --> 00:11:40.130
He must be very particular because of his lead role.

00:11:40.630 --> 00:11:41.760
Director Jean!

00:11:42.840 --> 00:11:46.260
We have a situation. In the next scene...

00:11:47.010 --> 00:11:52.350
The next shot we had planned was the last scene, where Tsubasa-san jumps from a cliff.

00:11:52.350 --> 00:11:55.770
Unfortunately, the stuntman canceled at the last minute.

00:11:57.020 --> 00:11:58.690
What does that mean?

00:11:58.690 --> 00:12:02.570
The person who was supposed to jump off the cliff for Tsubasa-senpai can't come.

00:12:04.030 --> 00:12:06.370
So what's the plan?

00:12:07.660 --> 00:12:14.670
Didn't you tell me that if we didn't finish filming today, the movie would be canceled?

00:12:16.670 --> 00:12:19.510
Well, I couldn't really care less.

00:12:19.510 --> 00:12:22.680
I was never really invested in this role anyway.

00:12:25.430 --> 00:12:28.310
I'll do it.

00:12:31.680 --> 00:12:35.100
We don't need a stuntman. I'll jump.

00:12:46.450 --> 00:12:50.080
We don't need a stuntman. I'll jump.{since when does stars have this text thing}

00:12:50.080 --> 00:12:54.580
I told you that an idol doesn't need to do anything besides act like one.

00:12:54.580 --> 00:12:57.710
You're right, I am an idol.

00:12:57.710 --> 00:13:00.590
But at the same time, I am also an actress.

00:13:02.090 --> 00:13:04.130
But it's too dangerous.

00:13:04.130 --> 00:13:07.140
Exactly, it's over ten meters high!

00:13:07.140 --> 00:13:11.220
If you slip up the landing, think of what'll happen to your idol activities!

00:13:11.220 --> 00:13:14.600
Right now, I'm devoting everything I have to this movie.

00:13:17.100 --> 00:13:19.360
I understand. It's in your hands.

00:13:19.650 --> 00:13:20.610
Thank you.

00:13:26.570 --> 00:13:31.620
You'll be cornered against this cliff, and after jumping down you'll run to Taiyou-san.

00:13:31.620 --> 00:13:32.620
Okay.

00:13:32.620 --> 00:13:36.330
We've hidden air bags under sand at the bottom.

00:13:36.330 --> 00:13:38.630
Make sure to land on them.

00:13:38.630 --> 00:13:41.880
Understood. I'll be relying on you.

00:13:41.880 --> 00:13:43.880
We'll be waiting at the base.

00:13:45.550 --> 00:13:47.630
It's taller than I expected.

00:13:50.470 --> 00:13:53.310
But Tsubasa will be able to handle it.

00:13:53.310 --> 00:13:55.890
Hang in there. We believe in you.

00:13:56.810 --> 00:13:57.640
Thanks.

00:14:01.270 --> 00:14:05.650
After Tsubasa-san makes her jump and comes here, please say your final line.

00:14:05.650 --> 00:14:08.240
I doubt she'll be able to jump.

00:14:08.240 --> 00:14:10.410
Just a short "thank you".{though by any sane definition of "word", "thank you" is one word}

00:14:10.410 --> 00:14:13.410
Yeah, yeah. <i>Thank</i> you.

00:14:21.420 --> 00:14:24.550
Listen up! We're almost out of recording film!

00:14:24.550 --> 00:14:27.260
We've got one shot, no do-overs!

00:14:27.260 --> 00:14:28.300
Okay!

00:14:32.300 --> 00:14:33.560
Ready?

00:14:33.560 --> 00:14:34.560
Let's do this!

00:14:34.560 --> 00:14:35.560
Okay!

00:14:35.560 --> 00:14:36.810
Bring it on!

00:14:36.810 --> 00:14:38.310
Action!

00:14:48.150 --> 00:14:50.070
You have nowhere to run.

00:14:51.110 --> 00:14:53.330
I wouldn't be so sure about that.

00:14:53.330 --> 00:14:54.700
<i>Now for the jump!</i>

00:14:58.580 --> 00:14:59.830
Fly!

00:15:04.710 --> 00:15:06.840
<i>I knew she couldn't.</i>

00:15:06.840 --> 00:15:09.590
Fly! Fly, fly!

00:15:09.590 --> 00:15:11.590
Tsubasa-senpai...

00:15:16.220 --> 00:15:20.770
It's no good. Once you hesitate, 
it's too dangerous to finish the stunt.

00:15:20.770 --> 00:15:22.350
Stop—

00:15:21.350 --> 00:15:22.350
Don't stop her!

00:15:23.230 --> 00:15:25.360
She will definitely jump!

00:15:25.360 --> 00:15:26.440
But...

00:15:26.440 --> 00:15:27.730
Please!

00:15:33.950 --> 00:15:35.580
<i>I am Tsubasa.</i>

00:15:36.200 --> 00:15:39.120
<i>On the wings of my name, I shall fly!</i>

00:15:44.630 --> 00:15:45.380
She jumped!

00:16:02.390 --> 00:16:05.020
It can't be... Tsubasa-senpai?

00:16:20.330 --> 00:16:22.580
Just say "thank you".

00:16:24.250 --> 00:16:26.420
Why go so far?

00:16:26.420 --> 00:16:29.210
That's not the right line, you—

00:16:32.720 --> 00:16:35.930
I told you I devoted everything to this.

00:16:37.260 --> 00:16:41.350
When I chose this job, I resolved myself to do anything it took.

00:16:41.350 --> 00:16:43.060
Did you not do the same?

00:16:53.950 --> 00:16:55.450
Thank you.

00:16:59.410 --> 00:17:02.580
Thank you for reminding me.

00:17:05.210 --> 00:17:06.960
Cut!

00:17:06.960 --> 00:17:08.710
Amazing, yeah!

00:17:12.210 --> 00:17:14.720
Incredible, Tsubasa-senpai!

00:17:14.720 --> 00:17:16.550
Tsubasacchi!

00:17:17.430 --> 00:17:19.470
That was a fantastic stunt!

00:17:19.470 --> 00:17:21.140
I was touched.

00:17:21.140 --> 00:17:23.890
It was truly unbelievable. Excellent job.

00:17:24.430 --> 00:17:26.230
Kisaragi Tsubasa.

00:17:26.230 --> 00:17:27.270
Yes?

00:17:28.020 --> 00:17:31.360
I apologize for my rudeness.

00:17:34.860 --> 00:17:39.870
You are a true actress, and the greatest of idols.

00:17:39.870 --> 00:17:43.000
I loved Burn at the Sun.

00:17:43.750 --> 00:17:47.370
I consider you the greatest actor ever.

00:17:51.250 --> 00:17:55.970
I can't back down now. Guess I'll try burning like in the old days.

00:17:55.970 --> 00:17:56.970
All right!

00:17:57.880 --> 00:18:01.390
That concludes all of the recording for the main film!

00:18:01.390 --> 00:18:04.390
Now we'll move to record the theme song!

00:18:04.390 --> 00:18:06.390
Good luck, Tsubasacchi!

00:18:06.390 --> 00:18:08.350
I'm looking forward to it.

00:18:08.350 --> 00:18:09.600
Have fun!

00:18:09.600 --> 00:18:10.400
Sure.

00:18:10.400 --> 00:18:13.650
Show me what you can do on stage.

00:18:14.150 --> 00:18:14.990
I will.

00:18:21.070 --> 00:18:25.660
Burning red with the flame of battle, the Girls Flag Coord.

00:18:26.040 --> 00:18:29.420
Kisaragi Tsubasa, holding nothing back! {this is just so anything}{shinkenshoubu appears in the lyrics to idol katsudou, but it's not like our translation for that is relevant (alt: showing no mercy, getting serious, etc. you know)}

00:21:22.380 --> 00:21:25.340
Tsubasa-senpai's dress is super cool!

00:21:25.340 --> 00:21:27.090
I love how rock it is!

00:21:27.090 --> 00:21:29.140
Yeah, it's wonderful!

00:21:36.310 --> 00:21:40.270
Here's to the completion of a long filming.

00:21:40.270 --> 00:21:41.650
Cheers!

00:21:41.650 --> 00:21:44.150
Cheers!

00:21:44.150 --> 00:21:45.950
Cheers!

00:21:49.280 --> 00:21:52.160
That guy suddenly became a good person.

00:21:55.370 --> 00:21:57.170
T-Taiyou-san!

00:22:01.040 --> 00:22:02.670
Hey, Yume!

00:22:04.130 --> 00:22:06.470
We only came here to Aikatsu.

00:22:07.010 --> 00:22:09.430
Don't you remember what Tsubasa-senpai said?

00:22:09.430 --> 00:22:12.680
It's important not to leave a single crumb behind.

00:22:13.680 --> 00:22:17.140
And look how much there is! 
I wonder if we can even finish it all.

00:23:58.620 --> 00:24:02.670
Did you all notice the sports cars racing around the stage?{speaking of racing and hong kong, here's a piece of trivia: the road to ian's house when I went there was used for illicit nighttime street racing at the time (and probably still is)}

00:24:02.670 --> 00:24:06.960
S4 will continue to race around at the top.

00:24:06.960 --> 00:24:08.840
Please give us your support!

00:24:11.380 --> 00:24:14.470
My raw singing ability still pales in comparison to Rola's.

00:24:14.470 --> 00:24:18.390
But still, I want to beat her and have my CD debut!

00:24:18.390 --> 00:24:20.560
Next time on Aikatsu Stars!

00:24:20.560 --> 00:24:22.100
The Desire to Win.

00:24:22.100 --> 00:24:24.440
Become the first-star idol!
